      "message": "Here\u0027s an unrolled dot product:\n\nfunc dotProductGoUnrolled(a, b []float32) float32 {\n\tvar dot0, dot1, dot2, dot3 float32\n\tfor i :\u003d 0; i \u003c len(a); i +\u003d 8 {\n\t\tp :\u003d (*[8]float32)(unsafe.Pointer(\u0026a[i]))\n\t\tq :\u003d (*[8]float32)(unsafe.Pointer(\u0026b[i]))\n\t\tdot0 +\u003d p[0]*q[0] + p[1]*q[1]\n\t\tdot1 +\u003d p[2]*q[2] + p[3]*q[3]\n\t\tdot2 +\u003d p[4]*q[4] + p[5]*q[5]\n\t\tdot3 +\u003d p[6]*q[6] + p[7]*q[7]\n\t}\n\treturn dot0 + dot1 + dot2 + dot3\n}\n\ncpu: 12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-12700\nBenchmarkDotProductGo-20            \t    2227\t    527156 ns/op\t15912.96 MB/s\nBenchmarkDotProductAVX2-20          \t    9945\t    112050 ns/op\t74865.00 MB/s\nBenchmarkDotProductGoUnrolled-20    \t    5071\t    212596 ns/op\t39457.99 MB/s\n\nWithin a factor of 2 of the AVX2 implementation.",
      "revId": "3795dd5dec4955bf3db7e5840e43f66629f73fea",
      "serverId": "62eb7196-b449-3ce5-99f1-c037f21e1705"
    },
